 "intro_html": "Your rice seasoning: <b>chirimen</b> (baby anchovies), <b>sakura shrimp</b>, <b>bonito flakes</b> and <b>sesame</b>, each toasted <b>separately</b> in a dry pan, then tossed back into a quick-boiled soy sauce. The <b>nori flakes</b> — the bright green, Western-style kind — are <b>not toasted</b>: they go in at the very end, once everything is cool.",
