 "notes": [
  {
   "html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>You weren’t sure whether they were in yours, so both are optional.</li><li>Mirin adds a little sweetness and gloss; a few drops of rice vinegar brighten it.</li></ul>",
   "title_html": "Rice vinegar and mirin?"
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>The weights are a starting point, not your measured amounts — the ratio of fish to sesame is the part to adjust to taste.</p>",
   "title_html": "Amounts"
  },
  {
   "html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>The Western-style green flakes are similar to Japanese aonori.</li><li>Toasting would dull the colour, which is why they go in last.</li></ul>",
   "title_html": "Nori"
  }
 ],
