  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Dry pan, <b>low heat</b>, no oil. Toast <b>one ingredient at a time</b> and tip each onto a plate as soon as it’s done:<ul class=\"ing\"><li>baby anchovies — until dry, fragrant and crisp (3–4 min)</li><li>sakura shrimp — until fragrant (1–2 min)</li><li>sesame — until it starts to colour and smells nutty (~2 min)</li><li>bonito flakes, crumbled — about 1 minute</li></ul></li><li>Each one cooks at its own speed, which is why they go in separately.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
    "label": "low",
    "label_html": "<span>low</span>",
    "off": false
   },
   "id": "step-2",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Toast each one separately",
