    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Pour into the empty hot pan (mirin and vinegar only if using):<ul class=\"ing\"><li>soy sauce <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"2\">2 tsp</span></span></li><li>mirin <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"1\">1 tsp</span> — optional</span></li><li>rice vinegar <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"0.5\">½ tsp</span> — optional</span></li></ul></li><li>Let it bubble for just a second.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
    "label": "low",
    "label_html": "<span>low</span>",
    "off": false
   },
   "id": "step-3",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Sauce in, boil a second",
    "diagram": null,
    "diagram_title": "Diagram",
    "how": [
     {
      "caption": "Pour the soy (and mirin, vinegar) into the empty hot pan and let it bubble for a second.",
