   "part_id": null,
   "time": "seconds",
   "time_html": "<span>seconds</span>",
   "title": "Sauce in, boil a second",
   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Straight away, tip all the toasted ingredients back into the pan and stir until everything is coated.</li><li>It stays <b>a little wet and glossy</b> at this point — that’s how it should look.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
    "label": "low",
    "label_html": "<span>low</span>",
    "off": false
   },
